eligibility.criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Age ≥ 18 years;
* Current treatment with a GLP-1 receptor agonist for at least 4 weeks, regardless of indication;
* Referral for elective upper gastrointestinal endoscopy (isolated or combined with colonoscopy);
* Informed consent for both the upper gastrointestinal endoscopy procedure and study participation.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Urgent/emergency endoscopy;
* Previously diagnosed gastroparesis;
* Prior major gastric/esophageal surgery (e.g., gastrectomy, gastric bypass);
* Known or suspected upper gastrointestinal obstruction;
* Pregnancy;
* Refusal or inability to comply with the assigned fasting protocol.
